 Fortress
 (arcadian 3-12, def out by Jan CES)November:
 Blue
 RAM Extended BASIC
 (4-1 arcadian)December:
 Machine
 Language Manager
 (Arcadian 4-2)
 1982:
 (5 brand new releases, 2 3rd
