15731:
More information about Fawn Dungeon is on this page:


http://www.ballyalley.com/ml/ml_source/ml_source.html


There are letters that date the unfinished game to 1981/1982.  The ROM was found as part of the Bob Fabris Collection.  It was dumped in 2008 by Ward Shrake.


BASICarts began to be made in the mid-1980s, but many of them were made by Mike White in 2001 when he created more of them so that they could be included on Ward Shrake's original Astrocade multicart.  Richard Degler made some multicarts in the late 2010s.  Technically, the Bally BASIC Demo is a BASICart (it's a BASIC program that runs from cartridge), but it's not usually considered one as it's so early (1970s).


Adam


